  "m2_criterion": {
    "id": "M2_federal_assignment_context",
    "definition": "Current rights-cleared Nepal federal office/local-unit and ward assignments with five/seven-digit string codes, separately namespaced legacy editions, original script and explicit source relations. Require source/terms versions, retrieval times and SHA-256; reproducible real-row coverage, ambiguity and temporal validation; an approved published immutable artifact re-downloaded and verified through the actual AGID loader/API. Administrative geometry needs independent permission, source identifiers and an explicit postal crosswalk, otherwise geometry none with no coordinate-lookup claim; label any derived or virtual region separately. Exact civic numbers and buildings need independent permitted explicit relations. Neither arithmetic ward expansion, historical UPU examples, table counts, source names, PDFs nor synthetic tests establish national coverage, delivery validity or M2."
  },
